{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-empire-suites","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"empire-suites-peace-homes-group-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Empire Suites, an exquisite haven of sophistication nestled in the heart of Jumeirah Village Circle. The 15-storey residential building, developed by Peace Homes Group, is a perfect blend of modern design and architectural beauty. Inside your apartment, you'll find spacious, well-lit living areas with high ceilings, giving you plenty of room to relax. Empire Residences exudes sophistication, as the property is meticulously crafted using premium, branded materials.The residential building consists of luxury studio, 1, and 2 bedroom apartments.Among its features we can find:- Ensuite private swimming pool and cinema included in every unit- Exquisitely furnished apartments- Italian finishes and custom marble fittings- Exceptionally fitted kitchen with German appliances- Cutting-edge Smart home systemFrom Empire Suites it takes approximately 18 minutes to Palm Jumeirah, 20 minutes to Burj Al Arab, 23 minutes to The Walk JBR and 24 minutes to drive to Dubai Mall. Dubai International Airport (DXB) is roughly 29 minutes' drive and the new Al Maktoum International Airport is roughly 33 minutes' drive.Empire Development properties offer lucrative investment returns, with a history of outperforming the market and delivering substantial capital appreciation and rental income potential. It is considered in high demand among discerning tenants seeking luxury living experiences.","price":925431,"title":"Empire Suites","bitrix":{"id":802,"pf_id":"are.2.12842","source":null,"project_id":"Empire Suites","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Empire Suites","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Peace Homes Group","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/540/images